    "text": "# Getting started with your Faithmade site\n\ntags: basics, login, wp-admin, editing, beaver builder\n\n*(Seed article — replace with the real Help Scout Docs export.)*\n\nYour Faithmade website runs on WordPress with the Beaver Builder page builder. Log in at `yoursite.org/wp-admin` with the credentials from your onboarding email.\n\n- **Edit a page:** Pages → hover the page → \"Beaver Builder\". Click any text or image to change it, then Publish (top right).\n- **Sermons:** Sermons → Add New. Upload audio/video or paste a link; the sermon player and podcast feed update automatically.\n- **Groups:** Groups → Add New for small groups, with schedule and signup details.\n- **Events:** Events → Add New; they appear in your events lists and calendars automatically.\n- **Site colors & fonts:** Appearance → Customize. Changes preview live before you publish.\n- **Planning Center:** if your site is connected, people, groups, and events sync automatically — edit those in Planning Center, not WordPress.\n\nIf something looks broken after editing, don't panic: ask support to restore the page — every site is backed up.\n"
